== Tips ==
* The {{AN|Quick Hands}} perk does not apply on {{Item|Gemstone Gauntlet}}'s {{AN|Reduced to Atoms}} and {{AN|Kinetic}} abilities.
* The {{AN|Quick Hands}} perk does not apply on {{Item|Lesser Orb of Healing}} {{ConfirmationNeeded}}.
* The {{AN|Insightful}} perk does not apply on [[Pickaxe Ability|{{AN|Maniac Miner}}]].
* Not consuming {{stat|Mana}} due to the {{AN|Insightful}} perk does not trigger {{Enchant|Refrigerate}}.

== Trivia ==
* If a player is morphed into a {{Item|Rat Pet}} and moves near a player with a '''Crow Pet''' equipped, the {{Item|Rat Pet}} is despawned and the following message is sent in chat: <ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/HypixelSkyblock/comments/1s5p1ox/crows_apparently_eat_rats/</ref>
:{{Dialogue|&e&lOOPS! &7Your Crow ate <player>'s Rat!}}

